OL,5,G1345 Human Intelligence
OL,6,     FNaomi Alderman explores Voltaire's
OL,7,     FEnlightenment mind and his fierce
OL,8,     Fchallenge to authority,
OL,9,     Fsuperstition, and intolerance
OL,10,     Fthrough wit, exile, and relentless
OL,11,     Fdebate.
OL,12,G1400 The Archers
OL,13,     FLily has a confession to make, and
OL,14,     Fthere is further setback for the
OL,15,     FSnells.
OL,16,G1415 Fags, Mags & Bags
OL,17,     F1/6. Comedy set in a Scots-Asian
OL,18,     Fcorner shop. Sanjay's relationship
OL,19,     Fwith Grebo has hit the rocks but
OL,20,     Fcan Malcolm help? Written by and
OL,21,     Fstarring Sanjeev Kohli and Donald
OL,22,     FMcLeary.
