OL,5,G1445 Opening Lines
OL,6,     FThe series that looks at books,
OL,7,     Fplays and stories and how they
OL,8,     Fwork. John Yorke examines Midnight
OL,9,     FCowboy by James Leo Herlihy.
OL,10,G1500 Great Lives
OL,11,     FJames Aldred picks wildlife
OL,12,     Fcameraman and pioneer Eric Ashby,
OL,13,     Fwith help from Chris Packham.
OL,14,G1530 You're Dead To Me
OL,15,     FGreg Jenner is joined by Professor
OL,16,     FViv Gardner and comedian Morgan
OL,17,     FRees in 19th-century Wales to
OL,18,     Flearn about the fabulous,
OL,19,     Ftheatrical life of Henry Cyril
OL,20,     FPaget.
